ection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":6,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905786659","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905786659","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-08-10","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1203-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810","date":"2022-08-10","original_code":"746.1203(4)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-23","finding":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Supervision of Children: During interviews, it was discovered that a caregiver had been found sleeping when the children were awake and playing in a classroom in June of 2022. A video was obtained that showed this and confirmed that this did occur.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026352034","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Supervision of Children (26 TAC §746.1203(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-641","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810","date":"2022-08-10","original_code":"745.641","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-23","finding":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation: A person with a pending background check was found to be serving in a classroom as a caregiver to children.     This was corrected at inspection when the individual left the premises and will not return until an approved background check is received.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026271518","violation_type_title":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation (26 TAC §745.641)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4907-a-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810","date":"2022-08-10","original_code":"746.4907(a)(2)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-23","finding":"Installation and Maintenance of Loose-fill Surfacing - Nine Inches if Equipment Greater Than 5 Ft.: Loose-fill was not properly maintained in an area with a play structure taller than 5 feet. The loose-fill measured between 2-4 inches when it was required to be a minimum of 9 inches in depth.   The director agreed that children will not be allowed to play on the structure until the operation is able to bring in more loose-fill to reach the depth as required by minimum standards for child safety.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026311810","violation_type_title":"Installation and Maintenance of Loose-fill Surfacing - Nine Inches if Equipment Greater Than 5 Ft. (26 TAC §746.4907(a)(2))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-5319","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810","date":"2022-08-10","original_code":"746.5319","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Corrected at inspection","finding":"Smoke Detectors Testing: There has not been a monthly smoke detector check since January 2022. This was corrected at inspection when the director checked all systems and found them in compliance.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026512423","violation_type_title":"Smoke Detectors Testing (26 TAC §746.5319)","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2415-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810","date":"2022-08-10","original_code":"746.2415(b)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-23","finding":"AP Cribs - Only Snug Fitting Sheet and Crib Mattress Cover Allowed if Infant Younger than 12 Months of Age: An infant younger than 12 months of age was found sleeping in a crib with a blanket.     This was corrected at inspection when the caregiver took out the blanket from the crib.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026512424","violation_type_title":"AP Cribs - Only Snug Fitting Sheet and Crib Mattress Cover Allowed if Infant Younger than 12 Months of Age (26 TAC §746.2415(b))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3505-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220810","date":"2022-08-10","original_code":"746.3505(b)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-23","finding":"Diapering Procedures - Wash Infant's Hands: Caregivers in two classrooms were not found to be using proper hand-washing proceedures following diaper changes.","topic":"sanitation","source_record_id":"1026271517","violation_type_title":"Diapering Procedures - Wash Infant's Hands (26 TAC §746.3505(b))","topic_label":"Sanitation & hygiene"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220805","date":"2022-08-05","inspection_type":"Investigation of a report (self-reported)","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":1,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905918447","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905918447","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-08-05","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220805-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1201-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-474308-i20220805","date":"2022-08-05","original_code":"746.1201(2)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corre